'''Z-Onel Resurrected!''' (絶・死霊妖精クオリネム降臨, ''Zetsu・Shiryō Yōsei Kuorinemu Kōrin'', '''Absolute・Death Fairy Kuolinem Advent''') is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 14.2 Update|Version 14.2]] and appears on the '''7th''', '''8th''', '''21st''', and '''22nd''' days of every month. It is unlocked after clearing [[Last of the Dead (Merciless)|Z-Onel Rises!]]. The first stage yields 1 million XP when first completed, while the second stage drops the [[True Form]] of [[Phantom Cat (Rare Cat)|Phantom Cat]] - Bubble Cat.

