==Appears==
===English Version===
*The 7th, 8th, 21st, and 22nd days in any month
*First appearance: March 7th, 2025 to March 8th, 2025

===Japanese Version===
*The 7th, 8th, 21st, and 22nd days in any month
*First appearance: February 7th, 2025 to February 8th, 2025

==Trivia==
*[[The Final Corpse (Merciless)|The Final Corpse]]'s Japanese name, Saigo no Shisha (最後の屍者, "The Final Corpse"), is almost the same as [[Last of the Dead (Merciless)|Last of the Dead]]'s, with the only difference being that The Final Corpse spells ''Shisha'' (死者, dead person) as 屍者, replacing the kanji 死 (death) with 屍 (corpse). Saigo no Shisha is also the Japanese title of ''[[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event|Neon Genesis Evangelion]]'' [https://wiki.evageeks.org/Episode_24 Episode 24], except the episode's title spells ''Shisha'' as シ者, allowing it to be interpreted as either "The Final Dead Person" or "The Final Messenger"; this wordplay is used in [[Cruel Angel Clionel]]'s Japanese description as well.
*[[With Sympathy (Merciless)|With Sympathy]]'s Japanese name, Magokoro o Neko ni (まごころをネコに, "Sincerely the Cat's"), is a reference to ''Magokoro o, Kimi ni'' (まごころを、君に, "Sincerely Yours"), which is the Japanese title of both ''[[wikipedia:Flowers for Algernon|Flowers for Algernon]]'' and [https://wiki.evageeks.org/Episode_26%27 Episode 26'] of ''Neon Genesis Evangelion''.

